        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Misri geegala gubooyeanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damwanagi, bea sheedeaba samwagu, eaweeda madeeda bea sheeda, hean goobaloolan ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, eeshiina Farao was sugoocheanda Misri ea eemeadaanyi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Heapi aba jeeda hawundaang'u guwuurjeewi ng'eaha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'i giwuurjeewi gubooyeanda Lebanoni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA aba gideaba nigeawiidi, ak geawundaanyi gagul shamooghuutka, ak gurooroadaanyi ghaghwar geaw aba geawundaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydayiin geatinga dea asagi hoauur, bea eemoojiga, ak gaygwasima ng'asheega deaschi sea munyindaanyi ghaahoanyi aba munyindaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea rabasta, ea fuga eemoojiga bea gharbeeda gwajaksa ng'eanyi ak ghwanung'wa heeda, aba iheenga giijeega ea jeeda moangoachihajeega sean damealgaaschi niibeada. Nea damealgaaschi ea nigiishachi aba murdeeda maparoojiga sean bea ng'eanyiida, nea buuneesean bea ng'eanyiida ea nirarang'aan, nea gwaleabu jeeda jirooneadaanyi ak ghwanung'wa heeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea uhuuda eemeegaaschi gaygoobiida dariidaka sean bea humng'eeda, nea iheenga damealgaaschi gaygoobiida diyeanga sean bea dareabeeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba geeta was sean mida ghuuta beega, adaghaghwar geaw aba geawundaanyi, nea adagagul geawundaanyi shamooghuutka ak eara geediga nyas beega ea mageawiida ea ghwasuut suurja. Aba gideaba gaygameewa sean, ak gaweay uuta ng'eanyiida bugusta buuneeda, sea geaweay jeeda shoomanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, eaweeda ghayi rarang'aadawa ea ghwahita gheeda maloonghajeega, ghaabwarghaanyi misaneeda haw aba badaydaanyi, ak geadukuti, ak ghaaghajaamnyi eenigaaschi ea beagaaschi saang'a gulda ghaanung' goosha. Ak ghaanung' gamisaniit Lebanoni aba badaydaanyi nea goohiili geediga sean bea dareabeeta aba badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaanung' gaboodani eemoojiga aba nyeashta giibeedeaydaanyi, damanda eajakseewi ng'eanyi ea ghwahita gheeda maloonghajeega. Sea saawa gea rarang'eesa jeeda shoomanda, ea geediga sean bea Edeni, ea geediga siloat miyaasiin bea Lebanoni ghayi siyiin beega, ghahawda aba hing'eadayda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara saawa ghwararang'aada sea niny gaweay gheeda maloonghajeega heeda fuga ghayi sinuus aba ng'uta. Was gea ghayi abiita jirooneadaanyi aba bugusta eemoojiga gajealas uhuuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba miyinda ea hawundeada geedi manda geeta, manda geeta wassean jea eegala aba jeeda boostaaneeda Edeni. Asi geedi ang'iing'i gil Farao was sugoocheanda, ang'iing'i gajeejakseey ng'eanyi heeda fuga nimeewa sea geediga Edeni. Gajeayiinyi heeda fuga mwanala ASEETA sea giika sibwara ng'utean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nih gichea uurjeewana Ea Farao, ang'iing'i ea fugaagu, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
